A.aNJ=s(["Flutter","ESP32","7 OSI Layer","MQTT HiveMQ","AI Rule-Based","Hive DB","Smart Home"],t.s)
A.aJe=s(["Penerapan Arsitektur 7 Lapisan Model OSI secara penuh (Layer 1 s/d Layer 7)","Inference Engine AI Rule-Based Decision System (Forward Chaining) dengan 100% akurasi","Response Time sangat cepat 180 ms & QoS standar ITU-T Y.1010/G.1010 (Packet Loss 0%)","Fitur aplikasi STARZAR: Biometrik Sidik Jari, Notifikasi Pop-up Mode Senyap, & Ekspor Excel (.xlsx)"],t.s)
A.aNz=s(["Complete 7-Layer OSI Model architectural design (Layer 1 to Layer 7)","AI Rule-Based Decision System (Forward Chaining) with 100% decision accuracy","Ultra-fast 180 ms response time & ITU-T Y.1010/G.1010 QoS benchmark (0% Packet Loss)","STARZAR app features: Biometric Auth, Silent Pop-up Alerts, & Excel (.xlsx) Export"],t.s)
A.XS=new B.aQ(63476,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
A.aTZ=new B.ka("STARZAR - Smart Exclusive Home IoT & AI","STARZAR - Smart Exclusive Home IoT & AI","Proyek Skripsi: Penerapan 7 Lapisan Model OSI & AI Rule-Based System","Bachelor Thesis: Full 7-Layer OSI Model Implementation & AI Rule-Based System","Sistem siber-fisik (Cyber-Physical System) smart home terpadu berbasis mikrokontroler ESP32, broker HiveMQ Cloud, dan aplikasi Android Flutter STARZAR dengan penerapan lengkap 7 Lapisan OSI Layer.","Integrated cyber-physical smart home system powered by ESP32 microcontrollers, HiveMQ Cloud MQTT broker, and STARZAR Flutter Android application implementing all 7 OSI Layers.","Proyek Skripsi Sarjana Terapan Teknik (S.Tr.T.) Program Studi D4 Teknologi Rekayasa Komputer Jaringan (TRKJ), Jurusan Teknologi Informasi dan Komputer (TIK) Politeknik Negeri Lhokseumawe (2026) oleh Nazarul Qudri, S.Tr.T.\n\nSistem ini mengintegrasikan mikrokontroler ESP32 multi-zona (Dapur, Ruang Tamu, dan Kamar Mandi) dengan sensor DHT22, MQ-2, MQ-135, Flame IR, dan HC-SR04 untuk mitigasi kebakaran, stabilitas suhu, dan manajemen air otomatis.\n\n\u25a0 IMPLEMENTASI LENGKAP 7 LAPISAN MODEL OSI:\n\u2022 Layer 7 (Application Layer): Aplikasi Android Flutter STARZAR & protokol MQTT dengan kontrol manual (manual override), autentikasi biometrik sidik jari, monitoring grafik real-time, notifikasi pop-up mode senyap, dan ekspor data XLSX.\n\u2022 Layer 6 (Presentation Layer): Enkapsulasi data telemetri berformat JSON String dan serialisasi basis data lokal Hive.\n\u2022 Layer 5 (Session Layer): Manajemen sesi komunikasi nirkabel Publish/Subscribe antara publisher ESP32 dan subscriber Flutter via HiveMQ Cloud.\n\u2022 Layer 4 (Transport Layer): Protokol Transmission Control Protocol (TCP) yang menjamin keandalan pengiriman dengan Packet Loss 0%.\n\u2022 Layer 3 (Network Layer): Internet Protocol (IP) untuk pengalamatan perangkat dan routing jaringan antar-node.\n\u2022 Layer 2 (Data Link Layer): Standar IEEE 802.11 (Wi-Fi Protocol) untuk manajemen frame dan verifikasi MAC address.\n\u2022 Layer 1 (Physical Layer): Modul radio Wi-Fi ESP32, antena pemancar, modul sensor lingkungan, dan modul relay 4-channel & 2-channel.\n\n\u25a0 HASIL PENGUJIAN ILMIAH:\n\u2022 Tingkat Keberhasilan Keputusan AI (Rule-Based): 100% pada 10 skenario pengujian darurat.\n\u2022 Rata-rata System Response Time: 180 ms (Jauh di bawah batas toleransi ITU-T Y.1010 < 2000 ms).\n\u2022 Kinerja QoS (ITU-T Y.1010/G.1010): Throughput 4.8 kbps, Delay 180 ms, Packet Loss 0%, Jitter 12 ms.\n\u2022 Akurasi pembacaan sensor rata-rata: Di atas 96%.","Bachelor of Applied Engineering (S.Tr.T.) Thesis Project at D4 Computer Network Engineering Technology (TRKJ), Department of Information and Computer Technology (TIK), Politeknik Negeri Lhokseumawe (2026) by Nazarul Qudri, S.Tr.T.\n\nThis system coordinates multi-zone ESP32 microcontrollers (Kitchen, Living Room, and Bathroom) integrated with DHT22, MQ-2, MQ-135, Flame IR, and HC-SR04 sensors for proactive fire mitigation, environmental temperature stability, and automatic water management.\n\n\u25a0 FULL 7-LAYER OSI MODEL ARCHITECTURAL IMPLEMENTATION:\n\u2022 Layer 7 (Application Layer): Flutter STARZAR Android app & MQTT protocol with manual override controls, biometric fingerprint authentication, live telemetric graphs, silent pop-up alarms, and tabular XLSX exports.\n\u2022 Layer 6 (Presentation Layer): JSON String telemetry encapsulation and serialization for local Hive database persistence.\n\u2022 Layer 5 (Session Layer): Wireless Publish/Subscribe session management between ESP32 publishers and Flutter subscribers through HiveMQ Cloud.\n\u2022 Layer 4 (Transport Layer): Transmission Control Protocol (TCP) ensuring zero packet loss (0% Packet Loss).\n\u2022 Layer 3 (Network Layer): Internet Protocol (IP) for discrete node addressing and subnet routing.\n\u2022 Layer 2 (Data Link Layer): IEEE 802.11 Wi-Fi standard for wireless frame handling and hardware MAC validation.\n\u2022 Layer 1 (Physical Layer): ESP32 Wi-Fi radio transceiver, antenna, environmental sensing modules, and multi-channel relay modules.\n\n\u25a0 SCIENTIFIC BENCHMARK RESULTS:\n\u2022 AI Decision Engine Success Rate: 100% across 10 distinct emergency scenarios.\n\u2022 Average System Response Time: 180 ms (well within ITU-T Y.1010 tolerance < 2000 ms).\n\u2022 QoS Performance (ITU-T Y.1010/G.1010): Throughput 4.8 kbps, Latency 180 ms, Packet Loss 0%, Jitter 12 ms.\n\u2022 Sensor calibration accuracy: Above 96% across all nodes.",A.Nr,A.aNJ,A.aJe,A.aNz,A.XS,A.S,A.d2,"100% AI \u2022 180ms Latency","100% AI \u2022 180ms Latency")
A.aLn=s(["E-Certificate","QR Validation","SKPI Integration","Web Platform","TIK PNL"],t.s)
A.aMg=s(["Generator e-sertifikat dinamis otomatis dengan nomor registrasi unik kampus","Fitur verifikasi keabsahan dokumen instan via scan QR code anti-pemalsuan","Akses mandiri bagi mahasiswa untuk mengunduh riwayat portofolio sertifikat kegiatan","Dashboard monitoring rekapitulasi capaian prestasi mahasiswa bagi pengelola program studi"],t.s)
A.aND=s(["Dynamic automated e-certificate generator with unique institutional registration numbers","Instant document verification via cryptographic QR code scanning to eliminate falsification","Self-service student portal to view and download historical achievement credentials","Department leadership analytics dashboard for monitoring student co-curricular milestones"],t.s)
A.TO=new B.x(1,0.6549019607843137,0.5450980392156862,0.9803921568627451,A.C)
A.aU_=new B.ka("Sistem Informasi Sertifikat Mahasiswa/i TIK PNL","TIK PNL Student Certificate & SKPI Validation System","Portal Penerbitan & Validasi E-Sertifikat Digital Mahasiswa TIK PNL","Digital E-Certificate Issuance & Verification Portal for TIK Students","Sistem manajemen sertifikat digital terpadu untuk menerbitkan, menyimpan, dan memvalidasi keaslian e-sertifikat kegiatan akademik, workshop, kepanitiaan, dan perlombaan mahasiswa Jurusan TIK PNL.","Integrated digital certificate platform to generate, archive, and validate e-certificates for academic workshops, committee honors, and student competitions.","Portal web resmi yang memfasilitasi penerbitan e-sertifikat digital bagi seluruh mahasiswa/i Jurusan Teknologi Informasi dan Komputer Politeknik Negeri Lhokseumawe.\n\nPlatform ini mengintegrasikan database mahasiswa dengan generator e-sertifikat otomatis, validasi keabsahan dokumen menggunakan QR Code anti-pemalsuan, serta pencatatan riwayat prestasi untuk mendukung Surat Keterangan Pendamping Ijazah (SKPI).","Official institutional portal facilitating the issuance and verification of tamper-proof e-certificates for students of the Department of Information and Computer Technology (TIK), Politeknik Negeri Lhokseumawe.\n\nIntegrates student records with dynamic PDF generation, anti-counterfeit QR Code verification, and comprehensive extracurricular achievement tracking to support the Diploma Supplement (SKPI).",A.nG,A.aLn,A.aMg,A.aND,A.xR,A.bV,A.TO,"Mahasiswa/i TIK PNL","TIK PNL Students")
A.aIa=s(["Web System","Document Repository","Security Auth","RBAC","Audit Trail","PNL"],t.s)
A.aNm=s(["Repositori digital terenkripsi untuk pengarsipan SK dan sertifikat kompetensi dosen PNL","Fitur verifikasi keaslian dokumen sertifikat dengan nomor identifikasi unik & QR verification","Pelaporan otomatis untuk kebutuhan akreditasi jurusan dan evaluasi institusi","Hak akses bertingkat (Role-Based Access Control) untuk Dosen, Jurusan, dan Pimpinan Kampus"],t.s)
A.aJ_=s(["Encrypted digital repository for storing faculty decrees and competency certificates","Instant document authenticity verification with unique serial numbers and QR verification","Automated reporting workflows for institutional accreditation and performance audits","Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) for Faculty Members, Departments, and Campus Leadership"],t.s)
A.we=new B.x(1,0.050980392156862744,0.5803921568627451,0.5333333333333333,A.C)
