A.aU0=new B.ka("Sistem Informasi Sertifikat Dosen PNL",u.k,"Repositori & Manajemen Kredensial Sertifikasi Dosen Politeknik Negeri Lhokseumawe","Institutional Credential Archive & Management for Politeknik Negeri Lhokseumawe Faculty","Sistem informasi repositori digital terpusat untuk pengarsipan, pencarian, dan verifikasi sertifikat kompetensi, keahlian, penelitian, dan pengabdian dosen Politeknik Negeri Lhokseumawe.","Centralized digital archive system for indexing, searching, and validating faculty competency certifications, research credentials, and community service certificates.","Sistem informasi berbasis web yang memfasilitasi pengelolaan berkas sertifikat dosen di lingkungan Politeknik Negeri Lhokseumawe periode 2025 - 2026.\n\nSistem ini menyediakan repositori digital aman untuk mengarsipkan SK dan sertifikasi kompetensi dosen, verifikasi keabsahan dokumen melalui nomor seri unik, serta mempermudah penyusunan portofolio akreditasi jurusan dan laporan Beban Kerja Dosen (BKD).","Enterprise web-based document repository facilitating the governance and archiving of faculty certification credentials across Politeknik Negeri Lhokseumawe for the 2025 - 2026 term.\n\nProvides a secure digital vault for storing official decrees and competency licenses, verifiable authenticity via unique document serials and QR codes, streamlining accreditation submissions and academic workload (BKD) reporting.",A.nG,A.aIa,A.aNm,A.aJ_,A.hC,A.we,A.TQ,"Seluruh Dosen PNL","All PNL Faculty")
A.aMB=s(["Web Portal","Laravel","MySQL","REST API","QR Absensi","TIK PNL"],t.s)
A.aJ4=s(["Form pendaftaran online mandiri dengan validasi NIM dan Prodi mahasiswa PNL","Sistem verifikasi kuota peserta dan pencatatan presensi kehadiran digital","Distribusi modul narasumber dan integrasi penerbitan e-sertifikat kegiatan","Dashboard administrasi Jurusan TIK untuk rekapitulasi data pendaftar & laporan kegiatan"],t.s)
A.aNw=s(["Self-service student registration with automated Student ID (NIM) & major validation","Real-time seat quota verification and digital QR Code attendance logging","Centralized speaker module repository and instant e-certificate generation","Department administrative dashboard for participant analytics and activity reporting"],t.s)
