A.aU1=new B.ka("Sistem Informasi & Pendaftaran Kuliah Umum TIK PNL","TIK PNL Public Lecture & Registration Web System","Website Pendaftaran & Manajemen Kuliah Umum Jurusan TIK 2025 - 2026","Web Platform for Guest Lecture Registration & Management 2025 - 2026","Portal web pendaftaran, registrasi peserta, absensi kehadiran digital, dan pengelolaan agenda kuliah tamu / seminar akademik Jurusan Teknologi Informasi dan Komputer Politeknik Negeri Lhokseumawe.","Web portal for participant registration, digital attendance logging, and event agenda management for guest lectures and seminars at TIK PNL.","Platform web terpadu yang dirancang untuk mengotomasi alur pendaftaran dan pelaksanaan kuliah umum tahun akademik 2025 - 2026 di Jurusan TIK Politeknik Negeri Lhokseumawe.\n\nSistem ini menghubungkan mahasiswa dari berbagai program studi (termasuk TRKJ, Teknik Informatika, dan lainnya) untuk melakukan pendaftaran online, verifikasi kuota otomatis, sistem absensi digital dengan QR Code, serta distribusi sertifikat kehadiran dan materi kuliah tamu secara terpusat.","An integrated web platform engineered to automate participant registration and operational workflows for the 2025 - 2026 academic guest lecture series at the Department of Information and Computer Technology (TIK), Politeknik Negeri Lhokseumawe.\n\nConnects students across departments (including TRKJ and Informatics Engineering) for self-service online registration, automated quota verification, QR Code digital attendance tracking, and centralized dissemination of speaker modules and verified e-certificates.",A.nG,A.aMB,A.aJ4,A.aNw,A.eI,A.cu,A.Tf,"1.000+ Mahasiswa TIK","1,000+ TIK Students")
